{'symbol': 'CTLT', 'date': '2023-04-11 19:15:00', 'title': 'CTLT INVESTOR NEWS: ROSEN, TRUSTED INVESTOR COUNSEL, ENCOURAGES CATALENT, INC. INVESTORS TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION – CTLT', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $CTLT #CTLT--WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF CATALENT, INC. (NYSE: CTLT) BETWEEN AUGUST 30, 2021 AND OCTOBER 31, 2022, BOTH DATES INCLUSIVE (THE “CLASS PERIOD”), OF THE IMPORTANT APRIL 25, 2023, LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE. SO WHAT: IF YOU PURCHASED CATALENT SECURITIES DURING THE CLASS PERIOD YOU MAY BE ENTITLED TO COMPENSATION WITHOUT PAYMENT OF ANY OUT OF POCKET FEES OR COSTS THROUGH A CONTINGENCY FEE ARRANGEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'CTLT', 'date': '2023-04-11 05:45:00', 'title': 'CTLT ALERT: THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF APRIL 25, 2023 IN THE CLASS ACTION FILED ON BEHALF OF CATALENT, INC. SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , APRIL 11, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION COMPLAINT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF CATALENT, INC. (NYSE: CTLT) ALLEGING THAT THE COMPANY VIOLATED FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS.'}